    "edit": {
        "tabs": {
            "quickStart": {
                "heading": "Add Incode identity verification",
                "subHeading": "Verify users with Incode when they sign up and when they sign in.",
                "steps": [
                    {
                        "title": "Onboarding client: add to the registration flow",
                        "content": "<p>In the self-registration flow, add the <strong>Incode</strong> step before or after the form that collects the username, and select a connection that holds an onboarding client. The step accepts only a passing Incode result, refuses an identity that is already registered, keeps the username chosen in the form and links the user to their Incode identity. Register <Code class=\"inline-code\">https://&lt;server&gt;/accounts/register</Code> on the client.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                        "title": "Face authentication client: add to login",
                        "content": "<p>In an application's login flow, add a connection that holds a face authentication client as a step after the step that identifies the user, for example Username &amp; Password, and keep that step as the subject identifier step. The connector sends the linked identity as <Code class=\"inline-code\">login_hint</Code> and requires Incode to return the same identity. Register <Code class=\"inline-code\">https://&lt;server&gt;/commonauth</Code> on the client.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                        "title": "Linked users",
                        "content": "<p>Login verifies users linked at registration by any connection made from this template. Keep JIT provisioning off. For a tenant, insert <Code class=\"inline-code\">/t/&lt;tenant&gt;</Code> after the server.</p>"
                    }
                ]
            },
